368	     * owner's normalized telephone, email (empty when absent) and household id joined with
369	     * {@code '|'} ({@code '<telephone>|<email>|<householdId>'}); any absent ({@code null}) component
370	     * contributes an empty string. Two owners are duplicates exactly when their whole identity keys
371	     * are equal, so two members of the same household with different telephones differ here and are
372	     * both allowed.
373	     *
