448	     * Resolves the effective registration date and rolls it onto a business day. An absent
449	     * ({@code null}) value defaults to the server's current date; a supplied value is used as-is.
450	     * The resulting date is then rolled forward so it never falls on a weekend: a Saturday or Sunday
451	     * becomes the following Monday, while any weekday is returned unchanged.
